<h3>Vowels</h3>
<p><b>A, E, I, O, U</b> are the five main vowels.</p>

<h3>Sentence Structure</h3>
<div class="formula">Subject + Verb + Object</div>

<div class="example">
<div class="eng">I read a book.</div>
<div class="hindi">मैं एक किताब पढ़ता हूँ।</div>
<div class="trans">आइ रीड अ बुक।</div>
</div>

<h3>Punctuation</h3>
<p>Full stop (.), comma (,), question mark (?), exclamation mark (!), colon (:), semicolon (;), quotation marks (“ ”).</p>
